  "IS no longer presents Non-controlling interests lines (NCI eliminated in 2023); net_income_incl_nci set equal to printed Net income; nci_income null (not presented).",
  "IS/BS/CF from 10-K; weighted average shares from Q4 release twelve-month IS. Interest expense presented net; equity earnings included in Other income (expense).",
  "BS no longer presents Total Shareholders' Equity / Non-controlling interests lines (NCI eliminated); total_leco_equity set to printed Total Equity; nci_equity null.",
  "Operating lease ROU asset / current / noncurrent lease liabilities taken from the Leases note table; on the face they are INCLUDED in Other assets / Other current liabilities / Other liabilities respectively (do not add to face lines).",
  "10-K BS: \"Amounts due banks\" mapped to short_term_debt; \"Current portion of long-term debt\" to current_ltd; \"Dividends payable\" kept in other_current_liabilities; \"Deferred income taxes\" asset in other_noncurrent_assets; accrued taxes / pensions not separately presented (null).",
  "CF line \"(Payments on) proceeds from long-term borrowings\" is a single net proceeds/(payments) line; mapped to lt_borrowings (net), lt_repayments null.",
  "CF starts from Net income (no NCI lines presented); net_income_incl_nci = printed Net income.",
  "ROIC figures are trailing-twelve-month as printed in the release (period ending this quarter; for Q4 identical to FY).",
  "2024-02-15 release Full Year 2023 highlights: \"Cash flows from operations increase 74% to record $668 million with 105% cash conversion\"; defined as CFO less capex divided by adjusted net income.",
